--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e41ecf4c2390fa24f80c77dd5df8b99b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tier01EnvironmentLibrary
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TheTrailWalker.Tier01EnvironmentLibrary
  Revision: 1
  DrawingContract: Reusable decorative art library only. No camp, route, reward,
    collider, save, graphics-profile or live scatter changes. Readable meshes, opaque
    shared regional palettes, separate shadow groups. Legacy Region01 remains 24
    colors; this kit uses 32 and must not be assigned to its hardcoded-24 terrain
    UVs. Each regional material is a separate combine group; split tall shadow casters
    from noncasting ground cover. Opaque geometry only. All terrain/water modules
    require authored stitching/replacement and must not be layered coplanar with
    the live terrain or ribbon. Use the current ground-height projection and road/camp/resource
    clearance when placing. No live renderer/quality settings are changed.
